{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38667","headline":"题顾正字谿居 · 李昭象","name":"题顾正字谿居","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"高敞吟轩近钓湾，尘中来似出人间。\n若教明月休生桂，应得危时共掩关。\n春酒夜棊难放客，短篱疎竹不遮山。\n莫夸恬淡胜荣禄，雁引行高未许闲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李昭象","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38667.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38667","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}